      "readmeExcerpt": "# Tomestone Search\n\nA Dalamud plugin for Final Fantasy XIV that adds context menu options\nto open player profiles on Tomestone.gg.\n\n## Features\n- Right-click player → Open on Tomestone\n- Works on other players and yourself\n- Uses home world detection\n- Opens in default browser\n\n## Installation (Private Repo)\n1. Build the plugin\n2. Host the repo (GitHub/GitLab)\n3. Add the repo URL in Dalamud:\n   - `/xlsettings`\n   - Experimental → Custom Plugin Repositories\n\n## Notes\nPrivate plugin – not distributed via official Dalamud repos.",
      "title": "Papers-Please-Dalamud",
      "url": "https://github.com/Averthian/Papers-Please-Dalamud"
    }
